---
import SectionWrapper from '../ui/SectionWrapper.astro';
---

<SectionWrapper>
  <section class="container content-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">STORY</p>
      <h2>What drives the company</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
      <p>E Deviser exists to apply intelligent systems thinking to complex real-world problems, with a strong emphasis on learning environments and decision-support for the future.</p>
      <p>As the company evolves, this story page should capture the underlying motivations and the practical context behind the work in a clear, editable format.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SectionWrapper>
